    "Estimate positions between reports": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "報告の間は位置を推定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The city's feed is rebuilt every 30 seconds and each bus reports every 30 seconds, so a position is about 25 seconds old when you see it. Automatic refresh asks right after each rebuild. Estimating moves each bus along its route at its last speed; a veiled bus has not reported for over a minute. Predicted arrival times are fetched only while a stop or bus is open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "市のフィードは30秒ごとに作り直され、各バスも30秒ごとに位置を報告するため、画面に出る位置は約25秒前のものです。「自動」は、作り直された直後に取得します。「推定」は、バスを最後の速度で経路に沿って動かします。薄く表示されたバスは1分以上報告がありません。到着予測は、バス停かバスを開いている間だけ取得します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%% early": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%% 早着"
          }
